WEBVTT

00:01:42.234 --> 00:01:46.304
Just because my tears have stopped falling

00:01:46.304 --> 00:01:52.074
That doesn't mean my sadness is healing

00:01:53.104 --> 00:01:57.214
I'm merely feeling the presence of

00:01:57.214 --> 00:02:00.284
The cowardly side of myself

00:02:00.284 --> 00:02:02.614
That's settled into my heart

00:02:02.614 --> 00:02:07.894
But I want to keep believing

00:02:07.894 --> 00:02:13.564
In the beginning of my little dream

00:02:13.564 --> 00:02:16.364
Little by little, my heart

00:02:16.364 --> 00:02:19.034
Is beginning to walk forward

00:02:19.034 --> 00:02:25.834
Dragging even the pain along with it

00:02:26.174 --> 00:02:32.714
Even if I lose sight of tomorrow in confusion

00:02:32.714 --> 00:02:35.414
My thoughts and feelings

00:02:35.414 --> 00:02:38.084
Will still search for the future

00:02:38.084 --> 00:02:41.394
I'll tire myself out crying

00:02:41.394 --> 00:02:43.594
Shedding so many tears it will form a rainbow

00:02:43.594 --> 00:02:46.994
And at the end of that rainbow

00:02:46.994 --> 00:02:49.694
I'll be standing there born anew

00:02:59.844 --> 00:03:04.804
The Four Musketeers

00:24:31.264 --> 00:24:36.224
In the Next Episode

00:24:56.094 --> 00:25:01.254
Sword of Indignation
